INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3279, 337, 'comment', 'owner', 'Step 1 done, commit 8f8f151b on lane/337 at 2.4.25 (the class gate takes one patch from 2.4.24 and lane/322b already holds 2.4.25 and 2.4.26, so the duplicate is allowlisted under the standing ruling and the merge that lands second renumbers above the first; the plan''s expected 2.4.27 cannot be one commit''s class step).

The oracle, fetched with the plan''s curl (key read straight into the process, never printed):
- Sat 24 Oct (BST): Fajr 06:02, Sunrise 07:37, Dhuhr 12:50, Asr 15:18, Maghrib 17:52, Isha 19:17.
- Sun 25 Oct (GMT after the crossing): Fajr 05:04, Sunrise 06:39, Dhuhr 11:50, Asr 14:17, Maghrib 16:50, Isha 18:17.
- Mon 26 Oct (GMT): Fajr 05:05, Sunrise 06:41, Dhuhr 11:50, Asr 14:15, Maghrib 16:48, Isha 18:15.
- The 24-25 night: Islamic Midnight 23:58 BST (22:58Z), Last Third 01:00 GMT (2026-10-25T01:00Z) - the fall-back instant itself, on the 25 Oct Extras list. The 25-26 night: Midnight 22:57 GMT, Last Third 01:00 GMT 26 Oct, both on the 26 Oct list.
- Fajr 25 Oct is 05:04 GMT, so Step 5''s watch runs 04:54-05:14 GMT.
- Countdown targets at R1 (01:55 BST): Standard counts to Fajr 05:04 (4h09m); Extras counts to the 24-25 night''s Last Third (5 minutes away), flipping to Suhoor 04:44 GMT once it passes.

Static proof: yarn test:tz green under all four device timezones; the fall filter reports 10 passed and the budget filter 5. Three gap tests landed, clock mocked, store seeded from the real 24-26 Oct rows: (a) the London date pins 2026-10-25 through both passes of the duplicated hour; (b) candidate arming at 01:30 GMT pins all 18 armed rows at their true UTC instants, the passed crossing-night rows (Midnight 23:58 BST, Last Third 01:00 GMT) left unarmed, the budget spent in instant order; (c) the countdown drops one second per real second across 01:00Z, counts the repeated wall hour as the real 3600 seconds, never 0 before the target. Each proven able to fail by a mutation pass: device-local clock under Pacific/Pago_Pago 2 failed, floor-for-ceil 1 failed, past-row guard flipped 3 failed, all reverted. No production code changed, no defect found: the pipeline holds as built. yarn validate green (232 suites, 5983 tests, coverage 100%).', NULL, '2026-10-24 21:20:15.55524+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', NULL);
