INSERT INTO public.issue_activity (id, issue_id, kind, actor_name, body, action, created_at, actor_user_id, initiative_id, reply_to_id, payload, edited_at) VALUES (3424, 347, 'comment', 'owner', 'Survey source list: each README section and the commits or ranges it was written from (app.json is the version spine; subjects walked unique per era).

- Identity, platforms, requirements: 2dcb0caa (web), 9336d37c + 8a526cd4 (tablets), bb8f6aa8 (SDK 58 stable, RN 0.88), 8ceaddfe (iOS 16.4 target), 8ef2ae95 (TLS 1.3, Android 9), 2d1915eb + dc269768 (2.4.39 store builds, both platforms)
- Prayer times and schedules: 1353ecf6, ebfe0f6c + 36caf837 (Isha rollover), 0f05e237 (Midnight), 1.24.6 + 1.24.12 + 1.24.14 (night times, year boundary, calendar days), dd2947e3 (extras order), e830f059 (1.27.0 dashes + day always shown), 82cbd204, b386fb04 + 4b32e7d8 (ceil, never 0s), d8f3eee3 + 78e757ab (clock changes, airplane-mode day)
- Countdown bar and Ago: 51951bf5, 2f967f50, c1ca913a, 9c3e4515, 0fcc9d38, a16393f7 (mint default), d71852b6, 3f5187f2 + 40d3a39f (default-off toggles)
- Prayer overlay: 83a4aa5f + 74bae76a, 9e99fdff + fcd470b7, 805569a5, 5aa0fd34, 334233b0 (1.24.0 rewrite), c79da28d (boundary lock), e3d3bf9d (ink veils)
- Notifications: ee57f0db, 81140d96, f8639f46, 96db3ab8 + bee081b4 (window shrink), 942b0cb7, 9bae5cd4, a524c47c (1.15.0 audio), 12c9caa3 (alarm-clock delivery), 1598e3bd (alarm stream), e5c84e55 (reboot re-arm), 9eccb74f (1.29.0 second reminder), b95b53a5
- Widgets: cbc0cf51 (1.7.0), 9348f0d6, 893544a7 (medium), 6b4102bc (stale card), 20c69999 (extras), 8119328f + 81f0b17b (Light/Dark at placement), f5bcccd1 + d3c9ba14 (settings mirror), 0b6e98f5 (Android self-refresh), dba69481 + c18b12e8, 9199f643, a08812ff + fcceee12 (locale/RTL)
- Qibla: 1e6676b0.. (session 37) through 2284f5e0 (vouched or nothing), 0cdb9bcb (Android fused wave), 8011095d + 57cba5e1 + f1e8a495 (cardinals), 5777b135 + a7a0c2c3 (dim blues), 5b58e2f8 (one subtitle line)
- Languages: fff42fb1..dcf8bae8 (1.29.325-334, Arabic column removed ccf85e68), 9ff32cab..997349b1 (2.0.20-37 five catalogs, language sheet), 31803a04 + 88a1c4fe (native digits), 18b7a9ea (Rubik), 11ef9083 (Sarabun), 353c860d (RTL pager), modules/switchcover
- What''s New: df08bfb1 (1.13.0), 20f62033 (versioned archive), b7334ed0 (2.3.0 store debut), b2b703c5 (grouped changelog), cce77819 (content-driven gate), 88605a3a + 0208c766 (copy, translations)
- Help page: 7cc39489 (2.1.0), b5406448, b9c0cc91
- Bottom bar: 44e0314e + 1a1ae80e
- Update prompt: 38c50fea + 810a3779
- Decorations: d6f03586 + 2bea96f8 + 0ec45ea6, b366b5fd (sprites)
- Offline: 1cb7f962 (MMKV), 6606a3b1 (empty-year retry), stores/sync December prefetch
- Stack and privacy: 6fb3a5af, 8ceaddfe, 1fc6c1ca (Biome), 78a8643d (TS 7), 65abb988 (permission strip), fb27e127 + c35b93d1
- Testing: 885f1c35, 472d84b8, 72a10bde (audio drift), fb98a462 (scroll sweep), 1898bdc3 (text-ink sweep), 1.24.20 (check:device)

Stale claims corrected: the large-overlay-font and Arabic-names settings (both gone from the tree, the language system replaced the latter), the ColorOS late-alert fix (shipped with the 2.4.39 store release, so the Upcoming list is gone), the modules line (switchcover added), the release ritual (the 2.4.6 content-driven gate). yarn validate green at 2.4.41 on lane3/T-347 (25b3adc0).', NULL, '2026-10-25 08:02:49.901048+00', 'DFppJIU20ig1j5gFRYQIe541IkO7Itfp', NULL, NULL, '{}', NULL);
