- 2026-10-20 D6 No JS change. The tall window delivers real insets into useSafeAreaInsets; honoredTopInset keeps its 2.1.24 clamp; Screen.tsx''s 500pt centred column renders portrait top-down in the tall canvas unchanged. The one-centred-schedule design ruling stands; nothing is redesigned. A tall-hold top inset reading above 62 parks the row in Awaiting Owner with the transcribed reading before any Done - the clamp exemption is the owner''s order to give with the reading in hand, row 271''s Decision 5 precedent.
- 2026-10-20 D7 The live-pose limitation carries over, recorded not chased: a process launched while the Duo is closed keeps its letterboxed rendering after unfold until its next relaunch (row 271''s Step 2b closed both re-ask attempts as refused by the system). No SceneDelegate insertion lands in this row.
