- plugins/duoTallCanvas.js (new): the plist maximum plus the keying-free portrait-pair AppDelegate gate; pure exported edit functions, idempotent, throwing when the marker moves.
- plugins/__tests__/duoTallCanvas.test.ts (new): written red first.
