- Criterion (b): after the fix, ''xcrun simctl launch SIMULATOR_UDID com.example.athan'' returns a pid; the pid still runs 60 seconds later (spawn launchctl list | grep, or ps); two menu rotations (landscape left, then right, via the verified menu item) leave the app alive with portrait geometry (screenshot width < height, transcribed via sips) and no new abort line in log show.
