## Transcript (Step 1, 2026-10-28, rig iPad Pro 11-inch (M5) sim SIMULATOR_UDID, iOS 27.0)

No abort occurred on the rig in any run: `~/Library/Logs/DiagnosticReports/` carries no Athan-*.ips across the whole session, and `simctl spawn log show` carries no exception for the process. The crash''s abort line is owner-device evidence so far.

