- Shape A (fresh prebuild: gate + Mac pin present; plist UIRequiresFullScreen=false re-added by the toolchain, ~iphone=true, base array portrait pair, ~ipad all four): portrait launch holds (pid 4114); rotation then landscape-at-launch and concurrent rotation all hold their pid. But the scene follows the system wide - `UIKit:Orientation ... Scene will change interface orientation: landscapeRight (3)` at 02:27:56 under a portrait-only AppDelegate gate - the gate is never consulted on the scene path. The pre-ruled stop condition (portrait geometry held through rotation) fails on shape A.
