- Lane 2 takes the same patch number. The re-read-and-take-next-free rule in Step 2 covers it; any interleaving is recorded in the ticket''s audit comment.
- The XS read route breaks if the agent-device runner fails to prepare (its MCP server is already broken; the CLI answered its help text). Fallback: the Athan-76 sim read stands as the glass read and the ticket records why, the acceptance criterion naming the sim as the fallback surface.
- The fleettest-suffixed build needs fresh automatic provisioning for a new app id; `-allowProvisioningUpdates` with the paid team covers it, and a failure there parks the read on the sim fallback rather than blocking the merge.

